    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what does \"freeing\" even mean when you’re literally losing everything? i feel like i'm just shouting into a void and the void is just a bunch of automated emails and people who dont care. it feels so hopeless that no matter how much i fight, the system just wins. it's like there's no point in even trying to exist in a world that's designed to just ignore you.",
